#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:12
#: ed967a9bdd27403d87f4923b8264380b
msgid ""
"This article explains how to setup a `ModalAI VOXL-CAM "
"<https://www.modalai.com/en-jp/pages/voxl-cam-perception-engine>`__ for use "
"with ArduPilot as a substitude for a GPS allowing position control modes "
"like Loiter, PosHold, RTL, Auto to work."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何配置 `ModalAI VOXL-CAM <https://www.modalai.com/en-jp/pages/voxl-cam-"
"perception-engine>`__，将其与 ArduPilot 配合使用，作为 GPS 的替代方案，从而启用 "
"Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Auto 等位置控制模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:14
#: 2e41d2172e3a4071a6b5ba4c8911d49d 7b36b21007cb49fc8d0498e6b7575761
