#: ee7e665fff1a41fc9358e1eecf91aae2
msgid ""
"Connect the camera to the Ubuntu workstation, start and adb shell and `run "
"voxl-configure-vision-px4 <https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-vision-"
"px4-installation/>`__ (Note: you may simply press <enter> when asked for an "
"IP address)"
msgstr ""
"将相机连接到 Ubuntu 工作站，启动 adb shell 并 `运行 voxl-configure-vision-px4 "
"<https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-vision-px4-installation/>`__ （注意：询问 IP "
"地址时直接按回车即可）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:46
#: 47e2991484f944719df48091f1945b60 b9e45826fb644c74a0969fc0243b166d
