"run \"systemctl enable voxl-mavlink-server\" to configure the mavlink server"
" to start automatically"
msgstr "运行 `systemctl enable voxl-mavlink-server` 以配置 mavlink 服务器在启动时自动运行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:47
#: 492d563635204640b4eb94d460976ca1 4eb1f9364241418da3600db21a6ed162
