"Optionally `run \"systemctl status voxl-vision-px4\" "
"<https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-cam-user-guide-core/#view-visual-inertial-"
"odometry-data>`__ to check if VOXL is producing good position estimates"
msgstr ""
"可选：`运行 「systemctl status voxl-vision-px4」 <https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-"
"cam-user-guide-core/#view-visual-inertial-odometry-data>`__ 检查 VOXL "
"是否正在生成良好的位置估计"

