#: c847736cd4ff49a480952baa5bb00cf3
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 2 (MAVLink2).  Note this "
"assumes the camera is connected to the autopilot's \"Telem2\" port."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = "
"2（MAVLink2）。注意：此处假设相机连接到飞控的「Telem2」端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:55
#: 751b838dbceb4d9391df398a0e064f18 766251a8fa824879b5c09bdca53a19cb
#: 8e0c08f2122b46d4a0355d3b2065678a d96e56f8ebff45f18c6655c2cb47315a
#: e99ac9208af3451d9281fb921bc6cce2
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921 (921600 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921（921600 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:56
#: 0057c7d9c3ff48c88453661eefd42366 2f31ca8aeab74a6a87b3142f50f50df9
#: 8d48a712ccef485f889b0b3a52b742df ba5c351872544d2db33694d1c0a65fa0
#: ff955199bcc14b239413319da68d2d8b
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` = 1024 (Don't "
"forward mavlink to/from) to disable the camera's odometry messages from "
"being sent to the GCS"
msgstr ""
"可选设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` = 1024（不转发 mavlink "
"消息），以禁止将相机的里程计消息发送到 GCS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:57
#: 0a70558f87554c5399ba8a9077ba1ab3 3e71d80f343e4ff2861f13138a17509d
#: 551169e8b49642ccbc2f31090f3c3db1 5e7cc90b10ed4f43a2844cbf78ab51a1
#: 91926134f5124a15ae2580a1a61a436a
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`MAV3_EXTRA3 <MAV3_EXTRA3>` = 0 to disable sending the "
"SYSTEM_TIME message to the camera which has been known to cause the camera "
"to lose its position estimate (e.g. quality falls to -1).  Note this assumes"
" the camera is connected to the autopilot's second mavlink port (e.g. "
"usually Telem2)"
msgstr ""
"可选设置 :ref:`MAV3_EXTRA3 <MAV3_EXTRA3>` = 0，以禁止向相机发送 SYSTEM_TIME "
"消息（该消息已知会导致相机丢失位置估计，例如质量降至 -1）。注意：此处假设相机连接到飞控的第二个 mavlink 端口（通常为 Telem2）"

