msgid ""
"Optionally increase :ref:`VISO_QUAL_MIN <VISO_QUAL_MIN>` to 10 (or higher) "
"to only consume estimates from the camera when the quality is 10% (or "
"higher)"
msgstr ""
"可选：将 :ref:`VISO_QUAL_MIN <VISO_QUAL_MIN>` 增大到 10（或更高），仅在相机质量达到 "
"10%（或以上）时才使用其估计"

